  "source_message": "feat: automated quality monitoring — cron scripts, LLM-as-judge, drift detection

- scripts/cron-adversarial-sim.sh: cron wrapper for adversarial_sim.py (every 6h
  or weekly Sunday 02:00); logs to logs/adversarial-DATE.jsonl + error log
- scripts/cron-deepeval-report.sh: weekly deepeval quality report (Monday 03:00);
  saves to reports/deepeval-DATE.json
- src/compliance/training/llm_judge.py: LLM-as-judge using Ollama qwen3-banxe-v2;
  JudgeResult(verdict, score, reasoning); graceful fallback when Ollama unreachable;
  CLI: python3 llm_judge.py --statement "..." --category "A-compliance"
- src/compliance/training/evidently_monitor.py: drift detection with DriftReport;
  uses Evidently AI if installed, stdlib manual fallback (mean absolute delta);
  check_drift(corpus_dir, window_days=7) → DriftReport; max_drift_score=0.15;
  CLI: python3 evidently_monitor.py --corpus-dir ... --days 7 --json

